+variation of each path on \([\bot,t]\) is almost surely bounded by a
+deterministic constant \(V\).  Suppose moreover that there are deterministic
+monotone partitions
+\[
+  \bot=u^n_0\le u^n_1\le\cdots\le u^n_{m_n}=t
