+Lemma~\ref{lem:Martingale.eq_zero_of_localized_bounded_continuous_finiteVariation_of_variation_bound_continuousOn}:
+on each event where the stopping time exceeds \(t\), the stopped process
+agrees with the original process at \(t\), and the countable localization
+events cover almost every sample point.  Equivalently, after deriving the
+square-integral identity directly, use
+Lemma~\ref{lem:Martingale.eq_zero_of_bounded_continuous_finiteVariation_core}
+for each bounded stopped process and run the same localized-family exhaustion
+argument.
+\end{proof}
